<title>INDONESIA: Citra Marga says rights issue in Q3 1997.</title>
<headline>Citra Marga says rights issue in Q3 1997.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian toll-road operator Citra Marga Nusphala Persada is planning a one-for-one rights issue in the third quarter of 1997, Citra corporate finance manager Ilham Wardhana Sriegar said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>He said the rights issue was subject to shareholders' approval.</p>
<p>Ilham was speaking at an analysts' meeting in Jakarta.</p>
